WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Vegan Cashew Whipped Cream. 5 min · 8 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 4. 2 cups raw cashews, unsalted; 6 dates, pitted; 1 teaspoon vanilla extract; Water (just enough to cover the cashews)

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1. Add the cashews, pitted dates, and vanilla extract to a high-powered blender. Pour in just enough water to cover the cashews.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2. Blend on high until completely smooth and creamy, scraping down the sides as needed.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
You're ready. Use Make It for checkboxes on the page.
